he provisions of that paragraph were applied to him. (3) The exemption provided by this article has effect for the period during which the impediment exists. (4) The party who fails to perform must give notice to the other party of the impediment and its effect on his ability to perform. If the notice is CONVENTION ON CONTRACTS FOR THE INTERNATIONAL SALE OF GOODS"